WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.790
A wedding at Cana.

2
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:06.340
6 stone jars, filled with
water, are found to hold wine.

3
00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:09.200
John calls it the beginning of his signs.

4
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:13.840
Matthew, Mark and Luke mostly
call such events acts of power.

5
00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:15.890
John chooses a different word.

6
00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:18.480
A sign is not the end of the story.

7
00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:20.510
It points beyond itself.

8
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.180
So what are John's signs pointing to?

9
00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:28.700
In this mission, you'll map all 7
signs, from Cana to a tomb in Bethany.

10
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:34.370
Then you'll weigh up a hard question: must
a sign have really happened to matter?

11
00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:38.030
Your mission: find out what
John's signs are pointing to.
